### 3.6 websocket

**Purpose**: Real-time communication ($connect, $disconnect, $default routes)  
**Location**: `backend/websocket/`

**Handlers:**
- `onConnect.mjs` — `$connect` route: JWT validation via `Sec-WebSocket-Protocol`, connection registration
- `onDisconnect.mjs` — `$disconnect` route: connection cleanup, presence broadcast
- `default.mjs` — `$default` route: message routing by action

**WebSocket Actions** (19 total):

| Action | Handler | Payload | Description |
|--------|---------|---------|-------------|
| `presenceLookup` | `handlePresenceLookup` | `{}` | Get online users |
| `sendMessage` | `handleSendMessage` | `{conversationId, content, ...}` | Send message to conversation |
| `markRead` | `handleMarkRead` | `{conversationId, messageId}` | Mark message read |
| `deleteMessage` | `handleDeleteMessage` | `{messageId}` | Delete message |
| `editMessage` | `handleEditMessage` | `{messageId, content}` | Edit message |
| `toggleReaction` | `handleToggleReaction` | `{messageId, reaction}` | Toggle reaction emoji |
| `timelineUpdate` | `broadcastTimelineUpdate` | `{projectId, event}` | Broadcast timeline change |
| `timelineDelete` | `broadcastTimelineUpdate` | `{projectId, eventId}` | Broadcast timeline deletion |
| `setActiveConversation` | `handleSetActiveConversation` | `{conversationId, revision}` | Set active conversation for connection |
| `timelineUpdated` | `persistTimelineUpdate` | `{projectId, event}` | Persist timeline update |
| `projectUpdated` | `handleProjectUpdated` | `{projectId, updates}` | Broadcast project updates |
| `budgetUpdated` | `handleBudgetUpdated` | `{projectId, budgetId, revision, ...}` | Broadcast budget changes |
| `lineLocked` | `handleLineLocked` | `{projectId, budgetItemId, userId}` | Lock budget line |
| `lineUnlocked` | `handleLineUnlocked` | `{projectId, budgetItemId}` | Unlock budget line |
| `setActiveRevision` | `handleSetActiveRevision` | `{revision}` | Set active budget revision |
| `clientRevisionUpdated` | `handleClientRevisionUpdated` | `{projectId, revision}` | Broadcast revision change |
| `userLocation` | `handleUserLocation` | `{projectId, location}` | Broadcast user location in UI |
| `fetchNotifications` | (inline) | `{}` | Fetch notifications for user |

**Outbound broadcasts**: Uses `ApiGatewayManagementApiClient.PostToConnectionCommand`

**Revision-aware actions**: `budgetUpdated`, `lineLocked`, `lineUnlocked`, `lockLineUpdated` (check `REVISION_AWARE_ACTIONS` set)

**Data Models**:
- **Connections** table (PK: `connectionId`)
  - GSI: `userId-sessionId-index`
  - Attributes: `userId`, `sessionId`, `activeConversation`, `activeRevision`, `connectedAt`, `expiresAt`

**Authentication Flow**:
1. Client sends JWT in `Sec-WebSocket-Protocol` header (first subprotocol)
2. `onConnect.mjs` validates JWT with JWKS from Cognito
3. Connection stored in Connections table
4. Presence snapshot sent to new connection
5. Presence broadcast to all other connections (excluding new connection)

**Local dev**: Not easily testable locally; use `serverless offline` with limitations or deploy to dev stage

