## 14. Appendix B — Data Model Index

### DynamoDB Tables (15 total)

1. **UserProfiles** (PK: `userId`)
   - Also stores `PENDING#{email}` records
   - Keys: `{ userId }`
   - Item shape: `{ userId, email, username, displayName, role, projects[], pending, createdAt, updatedAt }`

2. **ProjectInvitations** (PK: `inviteId`)
   - GSI: `senderId-index` (PK: `senderId`, SK: `inviteId`)
   - GSI: `recipientId-index` (PK: `recipientId`, SK: `inviteId`)
   - Keys: `{ inviteId }`
   - Item shape: `{ inviteId, type, senderId, recipientId, recipientEmail, projectId, status, createdAt, updatedAt, meta }`

3. **Inbox** (PK: `userId`, SK: `conversationId`)
   - Keys: `{ userId, conversationId }`
   - Item shape: `{ userId, conversationId, lastMsgTs, unreadCount, ... }`
   - Query pattern: `userId = :u` (get inbox for user)

4. **Messages** (PK: `messageId`)
   - Attributes: `conversationId`, `senderId`, `content`, `ts`, `reactions`, `edited`
   - Query pattern: Filter by `conversationId` (if GSI exists; not confirmed)

5. **ProjectMessages** (PK: `messageId`)
   - Attributes: `projectId`, `userId`, `content`, `ts`
   - Query pattern: Filter by `projectId`

6. **Notifications** (PK: `userId`, SK: `timestamp#uuid`)
   - GSI: `userId-index` (may be redundant; confirm in code)
   - Keys: `{ userId, 'timestamp#uuid' }`
   - Item shape: `{ userId, timestamp#uuid, type, content, read, createdAt }`
   - Query pattern: `userId = :u` (get notifications for user)

7. **Projects** (PK: `projectId`)
   - GSI: `visibility-index` (PK: `visibility`, SK: `projectId`)
   - GSI: `teamUserIds-index` (PK: `teamUserIds`, SK: `projectId`) — Note: set attribute, may not work as expected
   - Keys: `{ projectId }`
   - Item shape: `{ projectId, title, description, status, team[], timelineEvents[], thumbnails[], slides[], customFolders[], createdBy, createdAt, updatedAt, ... }`

8. **ProjectDirectory** (single-item cache; experimental)
   - PK: `__ALL__` (or similar)
   - Item shape: `{ projects: [{ projectId, title, ... }] }`

9. **Tasks** (PK: `taskId`)
   - Attributes: `projectId`, `title`, `description`, `status`, `assigneeId`, `budgetItemId`, `dueDate`, `createdBy`, `createdAt`
   - Query pattern: Filter by `projectId` (if GSI exists; not confirmed)

10. **Events** (PK: `eventId`)
    - Attributes: `projectId`, `title`, `startAt`, `endAt`, `description`, `createdAt`
    - Optional GSI: `projectId-startAt-index` (if `EVENTS_STARTAT_INDEX` set)
    - Query pattern: `projectId = :p` (if GSI exists)

11. **Budgets** (PK: composite `{type}#{id}`)
    - GSI: `budgetId-index` (PK: `budgetId`)
    - GSI: `budgetItemId-index` (PK: `budgetItemId`)
    - Keys: `{ '{type}#{id}' }` (e.g., `header#abc123`, `item#xyz789`)
    - Item shape (header): `{ budgetId, projectId, title, status, createdAt, updatedAt }`
    - Item shape (item): `{ budgetItemId, budgetId, projectId, description, amount, locked, lockedBy, revision, createdAt, updatedAt }`
    - Query pattern: GSI lookups by `budgetId` or `budgetItemId`

12. **Galleries** (PK: `galleryId`)
    - GSI: `projectId-index` (PK: `projectId`, SK: `galleryId`)
    - Keys: `{ galleryId }`
    - Item shape: `{ galleryId, projectId, title, slug, files[], createdAt, updatedAt }`
    - Query pattern: `projectId = :p` (get galleries for project)

13. **Connections** (PK: `connectionId`)
    - GSI: `userId-sessionId-index` (PK: `userId`, SK: `sessionId`)
    - Keys: `{ connectionId }`
    - Item shape: `{ connectionId, userId, sessionId, activeConversation, activeRevision, connectedAt, expiresAt }`
    - Query pattern: `userId = :u AND sessionId = :s` (find duplicates)

14. **ProjectCalendarTokens** (PK: TBD; not documented)
    - Used by cal service

15. (Additional tables may exist; confirm with `serverless.common.yml` or service code)

### S3 Buckets

- **mylg-files-v12** (default; configurable via `FILE_BUCKET` env var)
  - Stores user-uploaded files, gallery images, thumbnails
  - CORS configuration allows origins from `serverless.common.yml`
  - CloudFront distribution fronts this bucket

